  "description": "A child born to become a shaman with the fate of putting the world in chaos. To let go of his greed and refuse god, he's trying to become an ordinary office worker. Choi Yeonghoon, the one who can see destiny through physiognomy (face fortune reading) and fortune telling. Will he succeed in becoming an ordinary office worker? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
